{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Art Of War \u2013 is a 3D Waifu mystery RPG - Strategy Style powered by Unreal Engine 5.5 that offers a next-generation cross-platform gaming experience, with extremely beautiful visuals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Fate of the Last Witch Waifu will be fighting to survive in all kinds of scenarios, Each map is surrounded by challenges, to fight, such as final bosses and standard enemies, but it will not be easy, You will have to recruit a warriors to put an end to the evil that lurks, seeking to put an end to this bitter and cold year.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">[Enjoy hybrid combat]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">War weapons inject realism into a sci-fi setting, with designs that faithfully simulate the technology of powers from the future, past, and present. This combines with otherworldly, RPG-style skill mechanics to create a refreshing combat experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">[Become friends with agents]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Spend time with your Waifu Force teammates in the Base system. </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3342190?t=1745036388","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3342190/10507973a68f0c9f7ee0e69012b7ccde45e80569/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1745036388","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3342190/f1f17e7af540d76a2bec56700785084a283d3445/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745036388","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3342190/f1f17e7af540d76a2bec56700785084a283d3445/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745036388","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Art Of War \u2013 is a 3D Waifu mystery RPG - Strategy Style powered by Unreal Engine 5.5 that offers a next-generation cross-platform gaming experience, with extremely beautiful visuals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Fate of the Last Witch Waifu will be fighting to survive in all kinds of scenarios, Each map is surrounded by challenges, to fight, such as final bosses and standard enemies, but it will not be easy, You will have to recruit a warriors to put an end to the evil that lurks, seeking to put an end to this bitter and cold year.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">[Enjoy hybrid combat]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">War weapons inject realism into a sci-fi setting, with designs that faithfully simulate the technology of powers from the future, past, and present. This combines with otherworldly, RPG-style skill mechanics to create a refreshing combat experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">[Become friends with agents]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Spend time with your Waifu Force teammates in the Base system. </p>","developers":["Miki Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3342190/da23d6d527eb8a9ef0ceadd8f1835e95b6921d4c/header.jpg?t=1745036388","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257127969,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257127969/movie480.mp4?t=1745036386","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257127969/movie_max.mp4?t=1745036386"},"name":"TheArtOfWar","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257127969/aef04db3fdfda5374516a07e1ded1152b4de4fa0/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1745036386","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257127969/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1745036386","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstat